Snagarr
=======

Snagarr is a self-hosted tool that continuously hunts Sonarr, Radarr, Lidarr,
Readarr, and Whisparr for missing and upgradable media and triggers searches on
a schedule, with Swaparr stalled-download culling.

Source repository: https://github.com/Emkraan/snagarr


