Modifications
-------------

The Snagarr fork began in 2026, based on the elfhosted/newtarr fork of Huntarr
v6.6.3. Relative to that baseline, the modifications include the following. This
section is provided to satisfy GPL-3.0 section 5(a), which requires a modified
work to carry prominent notices stating that it was changed and giving a
relevant date.

  - Fixed the stateful auto-reset behavior so scheduled hunting no longer resets
    its processed-item tracking prematurely.
  - Hardened state persistence to protect the on-disk processed-item state
    against corruption and loss across restarts.
  - Rebranded the user interface and application identity from the upstream
    project to Snagarr.
  - Added Microsoft Entra OIDC authentication as a sign-in option.
  - Added a versioned configuration API.
  - Modernized the container image and the Python dependency set (updated the
    Python runtime and refreshed pinned libraries).

Relevant date: fork initiated 2026; see CHANGELOG.md for the release baseline
and https://github.com/Emkraan/snagarr for the complete revision history.


